  "name": "Black Market",
  "slug": "black-market",
  "teaser": "Fence and Flea Market questline and overhaul",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/MRU8jru53G6RSuR8PQhzmc0x1XuJd41XK14YMkZX.png",
  "downloads": 272,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<h1>DEPENDENCIES</h1>\n<pre><code>-&gt; Virtual's Custom Quest Loader 2.0.4\n-&gt; Quests Extended 3.3.0\n</code></pre>\n<h1>FEATURES</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Robust and documented config</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fence</h2>\n<h5>Assort</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Uses a whitelist system to only offer items chosen by the player.</li>\n<li>By default, Fence will offer highly coveted items, making it worthwhile to frequent his assort.</li>\n<li>By default, the whitelist supports the majority of custom items and equipment such as those found in WTT Armory, Massivesoft, Epic’s AIO, and more.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Questline</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>67 handwritten quests with photoshopped art–no AI used.</li>\n<li>Designed for a zero-to-hero playthrough.</li>\n<li>Fence assort, flea market buying, and flea market selling all progressively unlocked through the questline.</li>\n<li>+2.5 Fence rep from entire questline.</li>\n<li>Supports Quest Extended for increased quest objective variety. Hat tip to Light of the World!</li>\n<li><strong>Walkthrough coming soon.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Flea Market</h2>\n<h5>Buying</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete flea market offer rework.  All items that can accept attachments can be tastefully randomized.</li>\n<li>Dynamic offer creation to keep the market feeling alive.</li>\n<li>Full control over generated offer fundamentals.</li>\n<li>As the generations are dynamic, support for current and future custom items is included.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Selling</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Full control over offer count and reputation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Hideout</h2>\n<h5>Crafting</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom and seasonal item crafting.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Scav Case</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Reconfigured to accept only cigarettes, alcohol, and valuable information items.</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>HIGHLY RECOMMENDED MODS</h1>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2466/rarities\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rarities</a> (Seen in the screenshots)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2465/price-tag\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Price Tag</a></p>\n<p>All quests are handwritten\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689510184980542/bm1.png?ex=692658cf&amp;is=6925074f&amp;hm=f2bf110dc0a8c7bfc4823de49b4e33887c0ad750b1f4a63be62c98102f250b11&amp;\" alt=\"bm1\" /></p>\n<p>Ingame sneak peek\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689510906396752/bm2.png?ex=692658cf&amp;is=6925074f&amp;hm=26543b2858b3d081f34eb2fadbf1ced70eaebb7266990e104e1b597a0015ef45&amp;\" alt=\"bm2\" /></p>\n<p>The unlocked fence assort (only whitelisted items shown)\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689511804108800/bm3.png?ex=692658cf&amp;is=6925074f&amp;hm=99136aa85d03e6e60a4c0a56168542c0ac22814a54a41ba7f6b4d3fb3ec188da&amp;\" alt=\"bm3\" /></p>\n<p>Flea market locked warning\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689512332460062/bm4.png?ex=692658cf&amp;is=6925074f&amp;hm=8f7a614d3824c81029ca60706dd49f48e4bb207bd40f1d75950cbc086563d3b8&amp;\" alt=\"bm4\" /></p>\n<p>Randomized presets offered from unlocked flea market\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689513058078770/bm5.png?ex=692658cf&amp;is=6925074f&amp;hm=4f6d6fbdd0580ec27559ce715a4f55f0ee6a01fad8c13c7963bc3d4e051f1fe7&amp;\" alt=\"bm5\" /></p>\n<p>I don’t know how to make tabs, sorry :)</p>\n",
